| `dependency_audit.accepted.<app>.<advisory>.package` | string | `postcss-selector-parser` under `astro` `GHSA-rj75-hqrm-r3gf` | the npm package name the audit reports the advisory against, no whitespace; the key above it is the advisory id written `GHSA-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx` | `scripts/audit_dependencies.py`, through `scripts/config_loader.py`'s `dependency_audit.accepted` row | Ties the acceptance to one package: the same advisory found in another package is not covered, and a row whose advisory and package the app's audit no longer reports fails `make fe-audit` as stale, so a fixed finding's row is removed. | the advisory's severity, which the report states and `dependency_audit.fail_at` judges | when `frontend_stack` is `astro` |
